{"node":{"id":"ctkg:v3e-object-f9ac171d68c8622f62106397","canonicalType":"DomainConcept","label":"串联滞后校正","aliases":["串联滞后校正"],"description":"利用滞后网络或PI控制器进行串联校正的基本原理，是利用滞后网络或PI控制器的高频幅值衰减特性，使已校正系统截止频率下降，从而使系统获得足够的相角裕度。","teachingFields":{},"governance":{"reviewStatus":"approved","publicationStatus":"published","lifecycleStatus":null},"sources":[{"sourceEditionId":"hu-shousong-auto-control-8th","sectionId":"textbook-unit:hu-shousong-auto-control-8th@第八版/chapter-chapter-06/chapter-6/section-6.4/example-6.5/solution","label":"自动控制原理（胡寿松，第8版） · 首先，确定开环增益 $K$ 。由于"},{"sourceEditionId":"hu-shousong-auto-control-8th","sectionId":"textbook-unit:hu-shousong-auto-control-8th@第八版/chapter-chapter-06/chapter-6/section-6.4/item-3","label":"自动控制原理（胡寿松，第8版） · 串联滞后校正"}],"media":{"cardAvailable":false,"infographAvailable":false},"semanticSupport":{"supported":true,"readOnly":true}},"neighborhood":{"shardClass":"node-neighborhood","envelope":{"contract":"act-authority-shard-envelope/v1","authority":{"snapshotId":"snap-7f1549103098d6efcc8a3989a344c047af682df7d8b4bddd7a28101dee04e731","snapshotHash":"7f1549103098d6efcc8a3989a344c047af682df7d8b4bddd7a28101dee04e731","releaseId":"ctr:release:control-theory-engineering-v0.48","releaseSetId":"actkg-authoritative-candidate-control-theory-engineering-v0.48","activationId":"activation-496129c057621ffa53d9debe","activationHash":"99939af321dfb3ca10597df292c52ee01a4e4d92c3ad302c55c44d70fe1c5781","projectionId":null,"projectionHash":null},"catalog":{"catalogId":"adc-b04d72519f53806fad47f1a7de09d4b7dd45248bcc93994444f545eeb353c679","catalogHash":"b04d72519f53806fad47f1a7de09d4b7dd45248bcc93994444f545eeb353c679","catalogVersion":"v0.48-candidate"},"teaching":{"status":"available","projectionId":"proj-0734e5358355555b469aa054df5e0aacfcce6471454d107af7a3ef2e110e08dc","projectionHash":"0734e5358355555b469aa054df5e0aacfcce6471454d107af7a3ef2e110e08dc","teachingCacheFamily":"teaching-domain-proj:proj-0734e5358355555b469aa054df5e0aacfcce6471454d107af7a3ef2e110e08dc:0734e5358355555b"},"match":{"authority":true,"catalog":true,"teaching":true}},"nodeId":"ctkg:v3e-object-f9ac171d68c8622f62106397","limit":32,"truncated":false,"objects":[{"id":"ctkg:v3e-object-0b7d447826e3f8c1a8de8d12","canonicalType":"KnowledgeStatement","label":"采用滞后校正可能会得出时间常数大到不能实现的结果，这是由于需要在足够小的频率值上安置滞后网络第一个交接频率1/T，以保证在需要的频率范围内产生有效的高频幅值衰减特性所致。","aliases":[],"description":null,"governance":{"reviewStatus":"approved","publicationStatus":"published","lifecycleStatus":null},"semanticSupport":{"supported":true,"readOnly":true},"memberships":[{"domainId":"classical-control-design","visualRole":"design","preferred":true}],"conceptKind":null},{"id":"ctkg:v3e-object-4db8271ddf72e4739741af2c","canonicalType":"KnowledgeStatement","label":"1） 根据稳态误差要求，确定开环增益K。2） 画出待校正系统的开环对数频率特性，确定截止频率ωc'、相角裕度γ和幅值裕度h。3） 选择不同的ωc''，绘制γ（ωc''）曲线。4） 根据相角裕度γ''要求，选择已校正系统的截止频率ωc''。5） 确定滞后网络参数b和T。6） 验算已校正系统的相角裕度和幅值裕度。","aliases":[],"description":null,"governance":{"reviewStatus":"approved","publicationStatus":"published","lifecycleStatus":null},"semanticSupport":{"supported":true,"readOnly":true},"memberships":[{"domainId":"classical-control-design","visualRole":"design","preferred":true}],"conceptKind":null},{"id":"ctkg:v3e-object-66926d13971b8a280d1cdd1c","canonicalType":"KnowledgeStatement","label":"对于同一系统，采用超前校正的系统带宽大于采用滞后校正的系统带宽。","aliases":[],"description":null,"governance":{"reviewStatus":"approved","publicationStatus":"published","lifecycleStatus":null},"semanticSupport":{"supported":true,"readOnly":true},"memberships":[{"domainId":"classical-control-design","visualRole":"design","preferred":true}],"conceptKind":null},{"id":"ctkg:v3e-object-7572b812f994f30ab6f5b279","canonicalType":"KnowledgeStatement","label":"为了满足严格的稳态性能要求，当采用无源校正网络时，超前校正要求一定的附加增益，而滞后校正一般不需要附加增益。","aliases":[],"description":null,"governance":{"reviewStatus":"approved","publicationStatus":"published","lifecycleStatus":null},"semanticSupport":{"supported":true,"readOnly":true},"memberships":[{"domainId":"classical-control-design","visualRole":"design","preferred":true}],"conceptKind":null},{"id":"ctkg:v3e-object-77a4873907d81885333ef93b","canonicalType":"KnowledgeStatement","label":"如果将已校正系统对数幅频特性向上平移，则校正前后的相角裕度和截止频率基本相同，但开环增益却增大。","aliases":[],"description":null,"governance":{"reviewStatus":"approved","publicationStatus":"published","lifecycleStatus":null},"semanticSupport":{"supported":true,"readOnly":true},"memberships":[{"domainId":"classical-control-design","visualRole":"design","preferred":true}],"conceptKind":null},{"id":"ctkg:v3e-object-9a6884bcb25ea9ccd5153589","canonicalType":"KnowledgeStatement","label":"在系统响应速度要求不高而抑制噪声电平性能要求较高的情况下，可考虑采用串联滞后校正。如果待校正系统已具备满意的动态性能，仅稳态性能不满足指标要求，也可以采用串联滞后校正。","aliases":[],"description":null,"governance":{"reviewStatus":"approved","publicationStatus":"published","lifecycleStatus":null},"semanticSupport":{"supported":true,"readOnly":true},"memberships":[{"domainId":"classical-control-design","visualRole":"design","preferred":true}],"conceptKind":null},{"id":"ctkg:v3e-object-e89565638e04ac7e4dc14d25","canonicalType":"KnowledgeStatement","label":"1） 超前校正是利用超前网络的相角超前特性，而滞后校正则是利用滞后网络的高频幅值衰减特性。2） 超前校正要求附加增益，滞后校正一般不需要。3） 超前校正的系统带宽大于滞后校正的系统带宽。","aliases":[],"description":null,"governance":{"reviewStatus":"approved","publicationStatus":"published","lifecycleStatus":null},"semanticSupport":{"supported":true,"readOnly":true},"memberships":[{"domainId":"classical-control-design","visualRole":"design","preferred":true}],"conceptKind":null},{"id":"ctkg:v3e-object-f9ac171d68c8622f62106397","canonicalType":"DomainConcept","label":"串联滞后校正","aliases":["串联滞后校正"],"description":null,"governance":{"reviewStatus":"approved","publicationStatus":"published","lifecycleStatus":null},"semanticSupport":{"supported":true,"readOnly":true},"memberships":[{"domainId":"classical-control-design","visualRole":"design","preferred":true}],"conceptKind":null}],"relations":[{"id":"m1i:relation-582d0face33930c98a60229a","predicate":"applies_to","sourceId":"ctkg:v3e-object-0b7d